window.products.push({"id":437025,"name":"Metal Chopsticks Reusable Dishwasher Safe 18/8 Stainless Steel Chopstick Cute Multicolor Laser Engraving Non-slip Japanese Korean Elegant Chopstick fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s62vOcyWS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Multi-color laser engraved patterns: colored patterns are much more beautiful than monochrome patterns, and the metal chopsticks use permanent laser engraved patterns. The color will not fade after long time use. Each pair of stainless steel chopsticks has a different style. Each family member can have their own reusable chopsticks without worrying about mixing them. It is healthier and more hygienic. Material, Size and Style: Metal chopsticks are made of high quality 18/8 stainless steel and will not harbor bacteria or rust as easily as wooden chopsticks. Chopsticks are 9.8\" long and available in 5 styles with gift case. Non-slip design: our metal chopsticks feature a non-slip end and a square shape. Enhanced laser etching on the stainless steel tips makes the metal chopsticks easier to grip food and better anti-slip. The square-shaped metal chopsticks are easy to use and more comfortable to hold. Square shaped chopsticks do not roll in your hand, nor do they roll when placed on a table like round metal reusable chopsticks and spiral shaped chopsticks. Environmental protection: Support environmental protection! Reduce the use of wood and protect forests. Stainless steel chopsticks are really environmentally friendly when you think about the tons of chopsticks that turn into garbage every year. A pair of metal chopsticks can last 10 years or more. Suitable for Asian food: Whether you're eating noodles, rice, sushi, bento, Korean barbecue, or hosting an Asian-style dinner party, these tableware offer a more authentic experience and are a great way to improve dexterity and hand-eye coordination. Suitable for Chinese, Japanese, Korean and Vietnamese food. Suitable for parties, hotels, restaurants and families.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s62vOcyWS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CATHYLIFE","source_asin":"B08Y8XZ3RD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-437025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y8XZ3RD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y8XZ3RD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
