window.products.push({"id":437041,"name":"WHW Whole House Worlds World Traveler Seaside Suitcase Storage Boxes, Set of 4, Various Sizes, Over 2 1/2 Ft Stacked, Faux Leather, Wood, Lined, Brass","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gevUEMEqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ANCHORS, SURF, LIGHTHOUSES AND exotic seaside vibes make these eye-catching vintage French suitcase storage boxes ideal for adding a coastal accent to any room. Perfect for holding a variety of things, this set of 4 boxes are handy organizers with stunning style. WELL WORN LOOK like real vintage suitcases, these fine reproductions are detailed with legendary coastal motifs from years gone by, Crafted of durable MDF wood and fabric lined, each case is covered with faux leather and equipped with old fashioned flip latch locks. Contrasting faux details that are studded with metal brass tacks whisper of far away voyages. GREAT SIZES this set of 4 cases measures as follows: 1 - 20½ L x 15½ W x 8¼ 10.3 lb, H inches, 2 - 18\" x 13½\" x 7\" x 7.6 lb, 3- 15¾\" x 11½\" x 5\" x 5.3 lb, 4 -13½\" x 9½\" x 3½\" x 3.6 lb. When stacked, the collection of 4 is well over 2 1/2 Ft tall. COASTAL COLORS that work with what you already have, each carefully curated suitcase features shades of seaside blues, rustic reds, and gentle leather tones. Call outs to famous resort areas on the Atlantic coast, like Cote Basque, Biarritz, and Bayonne, plus iconic images of anchors, lighthouses and surfboards evoke voyages to sunny beaches where the surf is up. FROM LIVING ROOM TO BEDROOM our World Traveler Seaside Suitcase Storage Boxes, Set of 4, are useful pieces that can help organize spaces while pulling together a room with tremendous style. Enjoy! By Whole House Worlds Welcome to the product line of Whole House Worlds. The New York based company offers high quality, stylish products for every room in the house, and beyond. From the kitchen, to the living room, to the bedroom, dining room, home office, closet and garden: Our criteria are comfort, quality, style and value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gevUEMEqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WHW Whole House Worlds","source_asin":"B07B29SF8K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-437041","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B29SF8K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B29SF8K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
