window.products.push({"id":437053,"name":"GRT Bamboo Cooling Mattress Pad Cover Queen Size, Extra Thick Quilted Fitted Mattress Topper with 21 Inches Deep Pocket, Ultra Soft Breathable and Noi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ug9rXDsDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍀【OEKO Certified - Buy Worry Free】: GRT bamboo mattress pad certified standard 100 by OEKO-TEX, it does not contain any harmful substances or chemicals, we are committed to offer you and your family a healthy sleep, please buy with confidence. 🍀【Air Circulation System - Organic Bamboo Mattress Pad】We use up to 45% bamboo as the queen mattress pad surface. Quite a little micropores inside the bamboo fiber, which is a natural \"breathing fiber\". Compared with other fabrics, bamboo mattress pad queen size heat dissipation is more efficient, which helps hot sleeper stay cool and comfortable for a naturally breathable sleeping environment. 🍀【Extra Premium Polyester Filling - Fluffy and Noiseless】The GRT extra thick cooling bamboo mattress pad queen is filled with a lot of skin-friendly filling to maintain excellent softness without unpleasant odors. The four-leaf clover quilted design keeps the filling in place, provides perfect support for your shoulders and hips, and doesn't make any noise even when you roll over in bed, giving you a quiet and distinctive sleep experience. 🍀【360° Full Wrap Design - Cleaner Sleeping Environment】Deep pocket design quilted mattress pad for queen size bed can easily grab your mattress and present a smooth appearance. All-round protection on the top and sides, combined with the bamboo mattress pad, can keep your sleeping area clean. 🍀【Machine Washable & Sleep With No Worry Mattress Pad】Microfiber and bamboo mattress pad is softer and more durable than other materials, this queen size mattress pad is durable, remains soft and fluffy even after washing in the washing machine. Note: Machine washable on a gentle cycle, tumble dry on low heat, do not iron, do not bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ug9rXDsDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GRT","source_asin":"B09TRN25KS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-437053","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TRN25KS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TRN25KS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
