window.products.push({"id":437084,"name":"JUMMICO Stand Up Home Workstation T-Shaped Metal Bracket with Wood Tabletop, 48 in, Walnut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EO8c38MBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Health Science Office】 Long-term sitting will have a bad effect on our body. Standing and sitting alternately work is currently the most scientific and healthy office method. This desk not only allows you to have the most comfortable height when sitting, prevents your spine from bending, but also allows you to sit and stand alternately to work, relieve leg numbness and body fatigue caused by long sitting, makes your energy more concentrated. 【MEMORY ELECTRIC LIFT】The height of the table can be adjusted freely between 28 inches and 46 inches, and with a height display screen. You can adjust it to your most comfortable height when working, reducing the strain on the waist caused by long-time work and improving your work efficiency. The table has 4 memory height keys, you can adjust to a memory height with one key, and it can be re-memorized height, allowing you to quickly return to the frequently used height when using it. 【SOLID & STABLE】 The table is supported by a solid metal frame. The wide T-shaped foot design is one of the most stable supports. Even when used at the highest height, the table can maintain good stability, which is your reliable partner at work. The desk top is made of solid wood. The surface is added with a smooth, strong and waterproof laminated panel. This design makes it stronger than other desk tops and has excellent corrosion and oxidation resistance. 【PRACTICAL DESIGN】There is a wire collecting hole on the desktop, you can connect the computer wire to the bottom of the table through this hole, so that your wires will not be messy and keep your office area tidy. There are screw foot pads at the bottom of the table legs to adjust the height of the four supporting legs, which can keep the table stable even on uneven ground. 【WORRY-FREE WARRANTY】 Jummico has an excellent after-sale service team, Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions, we will do our best to help you to solve the problems you have. Hope to bring you the best shopping experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EO8c38MBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JUMMICO","source_asin":"B09B4V6L5X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-437084","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B4V6L5X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B4V6L5X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":437085,"name":"Caldo Canvas Kitchen Pot Holders - Insulated 100% Cotton Canvas Hot Pads for Oven - Heat Resistant - 2-Pack, 7” x 8” (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XvnmIolwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PROTECT YOUR HANDS FROM THE HEAT: These 100% cotton canvas pot holders are insulated enough to protect your hands, while not being too overstuffed to lose your feel for the dish. The 12 ounce canvas is extremely durable and will not lose its protective qualities. DESIGNED FOR MULTI PURPOSE FUNCTION: The 7 in wide by 9 inch long size gives you a few extra square inches of protection compared to the normal square pot holders. The textured 12 oz. canvas allows for maintaining a great grip on your hot dishes and the size lends itself to doubling as a trivet for hot dishes, providing ample protection for your table. MODERN STYLE: We know you’re sick of square terry cloth potholders that look ratty after a month in your kitchen. Bring some style into your home immediately with our rectangular pot holders in bold colors. The hanging loop provides easy storage and make for an easy way to add color and style to your kitchen. We found that pockets generally don’t fit your hand well, and fingers can easily catch on them. So we updated the design to get rid of the classic pot holder pocket. TWO-PACK, EASY CARE: Each pack comes with two pot holders of the same color. Machine wash and hang dry (tumble dry low is also ok). Spot clean if necessary with heavy grade dish soap like Dawn and boiling water. Oxiclean also works great. Try not to bleach, as this will wear them down more quickly. GREAT GIFT IN MODERN COLORS: These make a great for anyone you know who loved to spend time in the kitchen. Great for new homeowners, hosts, hostesses, cooks, chefs, entertainers and newlyweds. Designed in Seattle, Made in China.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XvnmIolwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caldo","source_asin":"B07N8HY7V4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-437085","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N8HY7V4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N8HY7V4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
