window.products.push({"id":437149,"name":"Cheer Collection Body Pillow, Ultra Luxurious Gel Infused Shredded Memory Foam Long Body Pillow 20\" x 54\" with Soft Breathable Pillow Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WqYUzR+iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The right body pillow can be the difference between waking up refreshed and energized, or aching and sore. Whether you like something to hug while lying on your side, or enjoy sleeping with a pillow between your knees, the Cheer Collection Gel-Infused Shredded Memory Foam 20\" x 54\" Body Pillow provides excellent support for a good nights sleep. The shredded memory foam conforms to your body and the bamboo fabric cover is soft and smooth for your enjoyment. Hug it for maximum comfort! Why Choose a Gel-Infused Shredded Memory Foam Pillow? Cooling gel sensation - Do you feel too warm at night? Don't worry because this pillow has gel-infused foam for a cooling effect.  Relieves aches and pains - Promotes proper posture and alignment and use as spacer between your knees.  Supports your body for better quality sleep - Provides body support so you can sleep without tossing and turning.  Distributes your weight evenly - Removes pressure points to your joints for all-night comfort.  Provides soothing comfort - Wrap your arms and legs around the pillow for a calming and secure feeling.  Reduces pain during pregnancy - Use as a maternity pillow to support your belly to reduce pressure to your back so you can sleep soundly. SPECIFICATIONS - Size: 20\"x 54\" - Filling: Gel-infused shredded memory foam, 5 lbs - Cover - Machine-washable 40% bamboo, 60% polyester knitted fabric with hidden zipper - Individual vacuum packed","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WqYUzR+iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cheer Collection","source_asin":"B07ZQSFW7W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-437149","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZQSFW7W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZQSFW7W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
