window.products.push({"id":437229,"name":"TEKAMON 3 Inch Memory Foam Mattress Topper California King Size,High Density Gel-Infused Cooling Foam Mattress Topper,with Removable & Washable Bamboo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715CDe7Kt1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Comfortable& Decompression】2 inches of gel memory foam is put on the top layer of the mattress, infused with temperature-adjusting gel beads, avoiding the overheating situation. 1 inch of bamboo charcoal memory foam is put on the bottom , which uses the infrared greenhouse and absorption effect of bamboo charcoal to eliminate odor and adjust humidity, improving sleep quality! These designs assure the softness and support of mattress, giving you a better sleep and making you more energetic! 【Cooling Bamboo Fiber Cover】The bamboo fiber bed cover is cooled by a six-side 3D air layer, so it has better air permeability, moisture absorption and soft touch, which makes you sleep more comfortably. In addition, the detachable zipper, making it removable and machine-washable, not only can effectively protect the mattress cover, but also convenient and durable. 【Anti-skid Design】Small anti-skid particles are evenly distributed on the back side. The mattress can be hold in place and no matter how you twist and flip the bed, it will prevent topper from any shifting and sliding. 【Healthier Sleep Environment】Our mattresses are certified by CertiPUR-US and OEKO-TEX. It meets specific standards for content and performance and flame retardants, mercury, lead or other heavy metals are not contained,has low VOC emissions for indoor air quality, which can assure you enjoy healthy sleep. 【Ten-Year Warranty】We are confident in the quality of our mattresses. QIANGWEI provides a 180-day risk-free sleep test. At the same time, we promise a 10-year warranty. If you are not satisfied for any reason, please feel free to contact us for a full refund.Please rest assured to buy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715CDe7Kt1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TEKAMON","source_asin":"B087X2WPK6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-437229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087X2WPK6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087X2WPK6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
