window.products.push({"id":437265,"name":"American Art Décor Rustic Wood Storage Cabinet with Shelves and Hooks - Vintage Country Farmhouse Décor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":203.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xPnx+PM2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add some shabby-chic and country rustic flavor to your home with this hanging storage cabinet that comes with three hooks for extra storage.Light colored wood and wood materials combine with a whitewashed effect to create a beautiful and rustic-inspired farmhouse decor cabinet. Unique in color and style, this shabby-chic, country rustic inspired piece has multi-functionality, ample storage space and three hooks for hanging lightweight items.Whether you use this attractive cabinet in your bathroom, kitchen, bedroom or entryway/foyer, it’s certain to pull focus and stand out as unique home decor item. Ideal for various home decor styles, this piece can work in a modern farmhouse kitchen, vintage inspired dining room, or a bedroom with natural wood accents.In addition, the cabinet comes outfitted with three 2-pronged hooks for hanging lightweight items such as keys, tools, cooking utensils, towels, tote bags or anything else. Finally, the top of this cabinet can also serve as an extra shelf; perfect for small plants, figurines and knick-knacks.Two keyhole slots on the back of the shelf make for easy wall mounting and installation.PRODUCT SPECS:Dimensions: 24” H x 20” L x 6” DWeight: 9.3 lbsTwo keyhole slots for hangingContains 1 cabinet","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xPnx+PM2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"American Art Decor","source_asin":"B07H44KN7M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-437265","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H44KN7M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H44KN7M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
