window.products.push({"id":437362,"name":"HuaLan Metal Chopsticks 18/8 Stainless Steel Chopsticks Japanese Korean Chopsticks Dishwasher Safe Resistant to Acids and Alkalis Fadless Anti-slip Re","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515As18AVeL._AC_.jpg","description":"Safe Material and Parameters:Our metal chopsticks are made of food-grade 304 (18/8)stainless steel. 304 stainless steel is widely used in the food and medical industries, with a density of 7.93g/cm³ and high temperature resistance of 800°C.Our stainless chopsticks have the characteristics of high density, high temperature resistance and corrosion resistance.It's reusable chopsticks，9 inches (23cm) long, 1.1 ounce (33g) per pair，5 pairs set. Chopsticks Dishwasher Safe and Hand Wash:Our metal chopsticks are durable plating ,the colored by electroplated technology,The steel chopsticks be placed in the dishwasher and disinfection cabinet,hand wash as well.Stainless steel chopsticks can be cleaned easily and will not hide dirt,no fading after long time use. Particular Treatment:We want your family to have a good dining experience and healthy tableware, the stainless steel chopsticks are more sanitary than bamboo chopsticks. Our metal chopsticks passivating treatment on the top to avoid unexpected injuries,no smelling,five colors available ,every family member can have his own personal reusable chopsticks. Non-slip Design and Easy to Use:Our stainless steel chopsticks are designed with a square body that is more suitable for gripping food,the chopstick body is designed with non-slip texture; square body design will avoid chopsticks from falling down from table while not using,really friendly to beginners and frequent users. Gift Set and Various Uses:Our metal chopsticks are packaged in gift boxes,beautifully crafted，Japan Korea China chopsticks style.Our chopsticks set can be used as holiday gifts among families and friends, birthday gifts, company annual meeting prizes.You can experience the customs of various Asian cuisines, such as left-field chicken, sushi, ramen, hot pot,you can also use our chopsticks to taste food from other countries to bring a different experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515As18AVeL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HuaLan","source_asin":"B0B77748YR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-437362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B77748YR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B77748YR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
