window.products.push({"id":437524,"name":"Mixcept 55\" Mid Century TV Stand Entertainment Center with 1 Door and 2 Drawers, Wooden TV Console Cabinet for Media Storage, Walnut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iWSj+w+EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Featuring a sleek manufactured wood finish and beautifully tapered solid wood legs. Plenty of storage space to keep games, media, electronics, accessories, books, and decor tidy, while has a cable management, means you don’t have to worry about tangled cords. This mid-century cabinet itself will be a beautiful spot in your house. Use it as a TV stand in your living room, a storage cabinet in your bedroom, or a buffet in your kitchen or dining room. Including a side cabinet with adjustable/removable shelf for closed storage space, 2 center open shelving and 2 drawers. The clean, mid century design is a great way to update your decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iWSj+w+EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mixcept","source_asin":"B09D9C77FK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-437524","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D9C77FK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D9C77FK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":437525,"name":"Rae Dunn By Magenta 4 Piece DIP EAT TASTE Ceramic LL Dip Bowl Serving Platter Set With Wood Tray 2019 Limited Edition","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AfD6iljRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3-Piece st of bowls. Ceramic and dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AfD6iljRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RAE DUNN BY MAGENTA","source_asin":"B082P41FQV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-437525","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082P41FQV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082P41FQV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":437526,"name":"Black Paper Towel Holder Under Cabinet, Paper Towel Holder Wall Mount for Kitchen, Adhesive Paper Towel Holder for Bathroom, Self Adhesive or Drilling","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OR4v5mmFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Premium Quality]: The under cabinet paper towel holders are made with premium SUS304 stainless steel. Sturdy and durable. The maximum load bearing can reach 11LB, strong enough to hold various paper towels, towels, plastic wrap, kitchen gadgets and bath gadgets. The under counter paper towel holder is also waterproof and rust resistant, can be used both in wet and dry environment and long lasting. Great for kitchen organization, kitchen decor, cabinet organization and bathroom organization! [Self Adhesive&Drilling ]: The kitchen towel holder comes with both adhesive and screws. You can choose the installation method according to your wall material. The adhesive is suitable for smooth surfaces such as glass, marble, tile, solid wood, metal. For rough surfaces such as painted wall, cement wall, plaster wall, paper wall, etc, the drilling&screwing is the right choice. [Solid Construction]: Unlike normal welding and hollow wall paper towel holder, our newly designed hanging paper towel holder has solid rod. The rod was securely locked by screws. No need to worry the rod getting leaning or break when holding huge paper rolls. [Hook end design]: The hook end of the wall mount paper towel holders can keep the paper roll staying on the holder, prevent the paper towel from falling off when you pull the papers vigorously, makes getting a paper towel easy. [Space Saver]: Our rv paper towel holder is slim and easy to install. You can stick the paper towel rack under or inside the cabinet, under the counter, on kitchen corner to give more space to your kitchen counter. The mounted paper towel holder can be installed vertically or horizontally for your convenience, makes your kitchen clean and tidy. [Wide Application]: The under the counter paper towel holder with 2 installation options, can be used in both smooth and rough surfaces in your kitchen, bathroom, RV, office, cupboard, camper, laundry room, pantry, craft room, garage, etc. The great choice to hang paper towel roll, towels, plastic wrap, and many other stuffs in your daily life! [NOTE]: The length of the rod for holding paper towels is 11.4 inch, please make sure your paper towel roll is shorter than 11 inch. If you choose the adhesive installation, please adhere the papertowel holder to suggested surfaces and wait for 24 hours to add towels. Our self adhesive paper towel holder is very sturdy and would be a great helper to free up your counter space. If you meet any problems with the cabinet paper towel holder, please feel free to contact us on the order details page.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OR4v5mmFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIGEEK","source_asin":"B0B9MX858K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-437526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9MX858K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9MX858K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":437527,"name":"BOVI Ice Cube Trays 4 Pack | 14-Ice Trays with Spill-Resistant Removable Lid | LFGB Certified & BPA Free | Molds For Freezer | Dishwasher Safe and Sta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jYYfedj0L._AC_.jpg","description":"FOOD SAFETY. Bovi ice cube trays are made of high-quality silicon and PP material which is considered to be the safest of all plastics and also is certified by LFGB and BPA-Free. So these 4 ice cube trays are totally safe and durable. Each tray makes 14 nice-sized cubes for a total of 56. This is perfect for home use, parties and bars etc. SO EASY TO REMOVE ICE. Each flat cube compartment is separate from others, with non-stick design, you can release ice cubes easily by pushing from the TPE soft bottom, no need to twist or crack ice molds like stiff plastic ones. After making ice cube with fruits, ice cream, soda or wine, simply rinse with it water or directly put into the dishwasher. REMOVABLE LID. Bovi ice cube trays come with a removable lid, this smart tool allows you to make nice cubes while keeps ice cubes from absorbing freezer odors. Moreover, these easy-release trays stack easily and neatly in the freezer without sticking. SAVE FREEZER SPACE. With our neat stackable lids each ice cube mould comes with a lid and sits on top of each other and this will help you to optimize freezer space and keep your ice fresh and odour free. SUITABLE FOR ANY PURPOSES. Bovi ice trays are perfect for cooling whisky, cocktail, wine, coffee, tea, lemonade, Coca-Cola, juice and more beverages; making baby food or delicious snacks like fruit popsicles, ice cream and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jYYfedj0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bovi","source_asin":"B0891QX1W5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-437527","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0891QX1W5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0891QX1W5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
