window.products.push({"id":437643,"name":"Claswcalor 4 Pcs Valentine’s Day Shower Curtain Set with Non-Slip Rugs, Toilet Lid Cover and Bath Mat, Red Love Heart Shower Curtains with 12 Hooks, R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XCyOSelCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Design Philosophy: Hope this red rose shower curtain can bring a sense of ceremony to your Valentine's Day, remind you to slow down and feel the beauty of life, cherish your lover, and cherish yourself. Quality Guarantee: If you have any issue upon receiving the item, please contact us immediately. We will respond within 24 hours and make sure your issue is well taken care of. Waterproof Shower Curtain: This romantic shower curtain for bathroom has good waterproof effect. When water splashes on the shower curtain, it will quickly merge and flow down, which is convenient for you to clean. Soft Bath Mat: Non-slip bath mat and U type rug are highly absorbent. Stepping on them after bathing can quickly dry your shoes and feet, and at the same time you can feel the comfortable experience of the delicate and soft flannel. HD Printing: Adopted HD printing, this rustic wooden shower curtain has vibrant color and clear images. Perfect for those who require high resolution. Size information: Knitting love shower curtain: 69\" W × 70\" L Toilet lid cover: 14.6\" W x 16.5\" L U shape rug: 15.8\" W x 17.7\" L Bath mat: 15.8\" W x 23.6\" L Easy to Hang: Our Valentines Day shower curtain has a good drape and doesn’t stick to the body. You can install it in a few minutes with the 12 hooks provided. Easy to Care: Hand or machine wash in cold water, gently and separately, no fading, no hardening. The retro shower curtain set is still soft and bright after washing, providing you with a good bathing experience for a long time. Packaged Included: 1 × Infinite love shower curtain 1 × Bathroom mat 1 × Toilet lid cover 1 × U Shape Rug 12 × Hooks","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XCyOSelCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Claswcalor","source_asin":"B0BL9266VY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-437643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL9266VY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL9266VY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
