window.products.push({"id":437657,"name":"8 oz \"Celtic Skull Iron Cross\" Black Genuine Leather Flask","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31TY3kz2CPL._AC_.jpg","description":"This 8 oz \"Celtic Skull Iron Cross\" Black Genuine Leather Flask is one of our best selling masculine flasks and will make it a great gift for Birthday, Christmas or other occasions. ********* Care Instruction: This quality flask will provide years of pleasure if you follow a few simple rules: 1) Your stainless steel flask is specially designed to carry alcoholic drinks. Is should NOT be used for beverages with an acid content, such as fruit juices and cordials. 2) Rinse the inside with clean water before filling the flask for the first time. 3) Always empty the flask after use use and rinse it out before refilling. 4) Do NOT keep alcohol in the flask longer than a period of 3 days. Refill only when you are about to use the flask. 5) If the flask is leather wrapped. Please follow the common care instruction for leather products as well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31TY3kz2CPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AWOL Masculine Collection","source_asin":"B00AE0AUVA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-437657","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AE0AUVA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AE0AUVA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
