window.products.push({"id":437663,"name":"Mfacoy 78 oz Glass Food Storage Jars with Airtight Lid, 3 Pack Large Kitchen Canisters for Flour, Cereal, Coffee, Pasta and Canning, Storage Container","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Vyxz4jfiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Ideal Food Storage Set】This glass jar set include 3 large 78oz food jars, measures 4.5 x 4.5 x 10 inch, which are ideal for storing a 2.5lb bag of flour or sugar. Except 3 airtight glass jars, you will also receive 8 pieces labels & 3 pieces chalkboard, which will help you never confuse flour with powdered sugar or baking powder with baking soda. They are reusable, you can switch contents whenever you need. 【Airtight and Keep Food Fresher】The Lids of these glass containers are airtight design, with rubber gasket clamp lids to ensure a leak-proof and airtight seal, keep your food dry and fresh for a long time. They open and close easily, don’t take a lot of force but give completely sealing and leakproof, and keep everything out, especially avoiding being infested by the moths and moisture. Also great for fermentation! 【Premium Thick Visible Glass】All the glass jars are heavy duty, super sturdy and durable, made of food-grade glass, lead-free, BPA-free, non-toxic and better than plastic. Clear, visible but thicker body allows quick recognization by easily seeing through what’s inside and is stronger than thin glass containers. 【Versatile and Wide Opening】Wide opening design make its easy to put in and take out your storage,easy to clean. Please clean these airtight glass jars by hand only with mild soap and warm water. These jars are versatile for storage, pickling, canning, and organization in your pantry, kitchen, countertop, and refrigerator. You can use them to store and serve a variety of food. 【Ideal Gift for Foodies】Meet all your needs for dry storage of spaghetti, fusilli, macaroni, pasta, cereal, oats, cheerios, cornmeal, rice, coffee, tea, flour, baking supplies, snacks, candies, sugar, hold your nuts, beans, grains, salt, cookies, and dog treats, etc. The glass jar would be an excellent gift choice for housewarming as well as Mother's Day. Friends or moms will be delighted by its reliable quality and sleek appearance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Vyxz4jfiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mfacoy","source_asin":"B0BBS9ZSRS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-437663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBS9ZSRS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBS9ZSRS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":437664,"name":"Melange Stoneware 32-Piece Dinnerware Set | Moderno Grey Collection | Service for 8| Microwave, Dishwasher & Oven Safe | Dinner Plate, Salad Plate, So","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cAa89r8yL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"An Everyday Stoneware Dinnerware Set Designed to Last and Impress Impress your guests, crown that dinner party, or upgrade your everyday dinnerware with an elegant stoneware dinner set that epitomizes durability. We’ve combined high-quality stoneware with a unique chip-resistant design to create a dinner set that you can use every single day without dealing with constant cracking, flaking, or chipping. - Vitrified at temperatures of over 2480F. - Microwave, oven and dishwasher safe. - 0% porosity for greater durability. - Complete set for service of 4 or 6 or 8 or 12. - Elegant patterns and lovely glaze. For Daily Use No dealing with fragile dinner sets that you only whip out whenever you have company. Melange dinnerware is strong enough to handle the rigors of daily use. You can safely use it in the microwave, clean it in the dishwasher without breaking, and even use it to reheat food in the oven up to 400F Everything You Need Every set comes with a dinner plate, salad plate, soup bowl and maybe a mug; everything you need to serve your family or guests a full course meal. Choose between our 16-piece set that comes with 4 of each piece and serves 4, or our 32-piece dinner set that comes with 8 of each and serves 8. Our sets also come in set of 18 with 6 of each – dinner plate, salad plate and soup bowl as well as set of 36 with 12 of each – dinner plate, salad plate and soup bowl. Understated Elegance Simple yet eye-catching, our range of designs exude an effortless elegance that blends into just about any setting. Beautifully done detailing meets lovely colors and a well-done glaze to create stoneware place settings with a premium feel. Get one set for yourself and a couple more as gifts and experience the magic of Melange. About Melange Melange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We believe fine dinner sets shouldn’t mean fragile dinner sets. We believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. That’s why we’ve used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone’s eye.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cAa89r8yL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B07B46ZHJ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-437664","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B46ZHJ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B46ZHJ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":437665,"name":"U UQUI Preserved Roses for Delivery Prime, Forever Roses in A Box Include Necklace, Fresh Flowers Real Rose Gifts for Her, Eternal Rose Long Lasting a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719xCw79syL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"U UQUI Rose Gifts: As a brand that deeply cultivates flower gifts, preserved flowers set is the perfect gift you've been looking for. 4 blue roses in square box instead of flower bouquets are more ornamental and gift-like. Ruby necklace adopt heart design radiates dazzling light. The black gilded greeting card u uqui prepared for you to help express your sincerity. Roses That Last Years: Eternity roses are real flowers, all selected from premium fresh roses, through fresh cut flowers, dried, kept fresh by special crafts and finally packed into designed gift boxes, deeply loved by rose lovers. No need for watering, no need for light, you just need to enjoy it, flowers in box have a lifespan of 2~3 years. Perfect Gift Idea: As anniversary or birthday gifts for women, preserved rose with necklace satisfies the dual gift attributes of roses and jewelry, absolutely an excellent present idea. You can make immortal roses as gifts for girlfriend, gifts for wife or gifts for mom. Besides, as sister gifts or friends female gifts forever flower also a nice choice. Applicable Scenes: Except as birthday and anniversary gifts, or important holiday gifts like Sweetest Day gifts, Christmas gifts, Valentines Day gifts, eternal flower is also suitable for all kinds of decoration ideas. You can make these preserved roses in a box as ornaments to be room decor, table decor, wedding decorations or romantic proposal decorations. Additional Notes: U UQUI rose flowers are non-toxic and fragrance-free, if you want the rose bouquet to be scented, you can pour a little perfume or essential oils into the bottom of the flower box. Ventilate these roses frequently to avoid mold, avoid strong sunlight to prevent fading of roses. With careful care, roses that last a year, 2 years, 3 years, or even timeless, to be ever gifts and decorations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719xCw79syL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"U UQUI","source_asin":"B0C3CWGLCS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-437665","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3CWGLCS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3CWGLCS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
